        <mxCell id="ANzJCg6MB-FmY9hBihJP-11" value="④ 双方独立执行密钥推导&#xa;PMK = HMAC-Hash(SNonce ‖ ANonce, DHss)&#xa;PMKID = Truncate-128(Hash(gSTA ‖ gAP))&#xa;PTK = PRF-X(PMK, &quot;FILS PTK Derivation&quot;,&#xa;SPA ‖ AA ‖ SNonce ‖ ANonce)&#xa;→ ICK / PTK-KEK / TK" style="fillColor=#ffff88;strokeColor=#9E916F;" vertex="1" parent="1">
